    "chunk_text": "\u00d0is synd Wihtr\u00e6des domas Cantwara cyninges. Dam mildestan cyninge Cantwara Wihtr\u00e6de rixigendum \u00fee fiftan wintra his rices, \u00fey nigu\u00f0an gebanne, \u00d0\u00e6r w\u00e6s Birhtwald, Bretone heahbiscop, & se \u00e6r n\u00e6mda cyning; eac \u00fean Hrofesceastre bisceop se ilca & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6lc had ciricean \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e anmodlice mid \u00fey hersuman folcy. \u00de\u00e6r \u00f0a eadigan fundon mid ealra gemedum \u00f0as domas & Cantwara rihtum \u00feeawum \u00e6cton, swa hit hyr.",
